{"parentUuid":"888efc0b-fde4-4177-b83b-bc120e975620","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaqtmnmYMZqpVGAnAATS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll take \"sections under that place\" to mean a **live panel under the tuner's controls** that fills in while a tune runs. Here's the plan:\n\n**Real time instead of polling every 2 seconds**\n- The server pushes each change to the browser over a live connection (server-sent events) as it happens.\n- If that connection drops, the app falls back to polling.\n\n**The live panel's sections**\n\n| Section | Shows |\n|---|---|\n| **Now running** | Each running model, its lane (CPU/GPU), stage and setting, a progress bar (answers measured against expected) and the time left |\n| **Trying now** | The values of the current setting, each with its score and response time, updated as each result arrives |\n| **Decided this run** | Every finished setting: what it chose, whether it changed or was kept, and why |\n| **Queue** | Models waiting, finished, skipped or failed, with the reason for failures |\n\n**Tidier structure:** the tuner area gets clear headings: Run a tune → Live → Models → Best model per task → Continue → Tune runs and statistics → Tune settings.\n\nThe baseline is still running on the GPU in the background, so I'll build and unit-test now. The visual check with a real tune waits until the baseline finishes, because a second tune would distort its speed measurements.\n\nReading how the scheduler handles progress events from each tune:"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":363,"cache_read_input_tokens":876203,"output_tokens":2238,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1578},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":363,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2238,"cache_read_input_tokens":876203,"cache_creation_input_tokens":363,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":363},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"29d774d1-28ef-4f93-afd8-1a84479a21b9","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cgaqtm7pwuVF1MuyqfzLa","requestRef":"fb8624b2-0e82-4648-8b7c-d43d778179aa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5008ffeb-59c7-436a-a543-dc7255475604","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:11:00.967Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\modelduck","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"master","slug":"noble-squishing-dawn"}
