{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","hash":"83cac1d33af3a55ededda38fecebd04df89b0fe1926a0a8b09dc0fd86f36a1dd","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm laying out the server plan: the scheduler will keep a live per-model summary and notify subscribers, and the server will stream it over `GET /api/tune/stream` with a heartbeat. Next I'm checking how the scheduler tests feed in a tune's output.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012tQiEu79GyGvSs3cBHFfoW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck && sed -n 1,60p tests/tune-scheduler.test.js","description":"Read the scheduler test harness"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
