{"parentUuid":"59480695-48c7-4e25-ac0c-4da44813851e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgar4nUDUn6c11HpoL3Pk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QiwWShr4BZCBXxGzh4p75s","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"npm test 2>&1 | grep -E \"^ℹ (pass|fail)\" && cat >> .aikit/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n### ADR-055: A running tune is shown live\n- **Date**: 2026-11-01\n- **Status**: Accepted\n- **Context**: The Bench panel polled the tune status every two seconds and showed only each model's last event (stage, setting, time left); which values were being tried, how they scored and what was decided were visible only after the run.\n- **Decision**: The scheduler keeps a live summary per model from the tune's events: answers so far against the expected count, the latest time left, the setting being tried with each value's latest round (score, time, tokens), and the last 30 decisions with their reasons. It calls subscribers after every change. `GET /api/tune/stream` sends the job at once and then after each change as server-sent events, gathering changes within 250 ms and sending a keep-alive comment every 15 s, and stops listening when the page goes away. The panel listens to it while open and falls back to polling if the stream fails.\n- **Consequences**: The panel shows a running tune's sections as it goes. A tune started outside the app (the CLI, the tune gate) is not part of the scheduler and is not shown live.\nEOF\ncd ../.. && python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep -q \"4/4 gates passed\" || { echo \"GATE FAILED\"; python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep \"   - \"; exit 1; }; python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --workspace projects/modelduck --checkpoint live-tune --agent claude-opus-5.5 --phase verification --phase-num 4 --desc \"[1/2] live summary and stream in; [2/2] live sections in the panel. Milestone 1: tests pass, gate 4/4; checklists: passed\" --why \"The user wants running tunes shown in real time with sections under the tuner\" --benefits \"A running tune shows its progress, what it tries and what it decides as it happens\" --risks \"contract: new GET /api/tune/stream and scheduler subscribe; dependency: none; concurrency: listeners per open page; state: none\" --mitigation \"Failing-first scheduler and server tests; polling fallback; ADR-055\" | tail -1 && MSG='feat(tune): [milestone 1/2] stream a running tune'\"'\"'s live summary\n\nThe scheduler keeps each model'\"'\"'s answers, time left, the setting being\ntried and the decisions so far, and GET /api/tune/stream pushes every\nchange to the page as it happens (ADR-055).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>' && python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --validate-commit \"$MSG\" >/dev/null || exit 1; cd projects/modelduck && git add src/tune-scheduler.js src/server.js tests/tune-scheduler.test.js tests/server.test.js .aikit/decisions.md .aikit/task_ledger.json && git commit -q -m \"$MSG\" && git log --oneline -1 && git status --short && cd ../.. && python aikit.py ui begin modelduck --surface app 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Add ADR-055, gate, commit milestone 1 and open the UI task","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1661,"cache_read_input_tokens":891678,"output_tokens":1340,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":64},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1661,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1340,"cache_read_input_tokens":891678,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1661},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QiwWShr4BZCBXxGzh4p75s":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck && npm test 2>&1 | grep -E \"^ℹ (pass|fail)\" && cat >> .aikit/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n### ADR-055: A running tune is shown live\n- **Date**: 2026-11-01\n- **Status**: Accepted\n- **Context**: The Bench panel polled the tune status every two seconds and showed only each model's last event (stage, setting, time left); which values were being tried, how they scored and what was decided were visible only after the run.\n- **Decision**: The scheduler keeps a live summary per model from the tune's events: answers so far against the expected count, the latest time left, the setting being tried with each value's latest round (score, time, tokens), and the last 30 decisions with their reasons. It calls subscribers after every change. `GET /api/tune/stream` sends the job at once and then after each change as server-sent events, gathering changes within 250 ms and sending a keep-alive comment every 15 s, and stops listening when the page goes away. The panel listens to it while open and falls back to polling if the stream fails.\n- **Consequences**: The panel shows a running tune's sections as it goes. A tune started outside the app (the CLI, the tune gate) is not part of the scheduler and is not shown live.\nEOF\ncd ../.. && python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep -q \"4/4 gates passed\" || { echo \"GATE FAILED\"; python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep \"   - \"; exit 1; }; python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --workspace projects/modelduck --checkpoint live-tune --agent claude-opus-5.5 --phase verification --phase-num 4 --desc \"[1/2] live summary and stream in; [2/2] live sections in the panel. Milestone 1: tests pass, gate 4/4; checklists: passed\" --why \"The user wants running tunes shown in real time with sections under the tuner\" --benefits \"A running tune shows its progress, what it tries and what it decides as it happens\" --risks \"contract: new GET /api/tune/stream and scheduler subscribe; dependency: none; concurrency: listeners per open page; state: none\" --mitigation \"Failing-first scheduler and server tests; polling fallback; ADR-055\" | tail -1 && MSG='feat(tune): [milestone 1/2] stream a running tune'\"'\"'s live summary\n\nThe scheduler keeps each model'\"'\"'s answers, time left, the setting being\ntried and the decisions so far, and GET /api/tune/stream pushes every\nchange to the page as it happens (ADR-055).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>' && python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --validate-commit \"$MSG\" >/dev/null || exit 1; cd projects/modelduck && git add src/tune-scheduler.js src/server.js tests/tune-scheduler.test.js tests/server.test.js .aikit/decisions.md .aikit/task_ledger.json && git commit -q -m \"$MSG\" && git log --oneline -1 && git status --short && cd ../.. && python aikit.py ui begin modelduck --surface app 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Add ADR-055, gate, commit milestone 1 and open the UI task","timeout":600000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01QiwWShr4BZCBXxGzh4p75s":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"f80dcab6-662b-44e3-bfdd-c50f290b9761","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgar4mrFz7UeZs5urJST5","requestRef":"034af3ef-b0d2-4599-b1e1-9bb835cedb67","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"020cfc90-d870-42ea-a326-217597cc8bd2","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:13:04.912Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\modelduck","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"master","slug":"noble-squishing-dawn"}
