{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","id":"b3795129-0b29-4b95-91ed-5087198c830c","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:18:36.613Z","version":"2.1.314","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"052e3386085e3c3d6b1840a4c2f3ad49514cc8fbcd78560b9e0bf4d24f30a986","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"a65a255b-9005-434c-987a-8624075a6ca7","keep":1348,"tail":["ba0bb0b5a4e483e835a24a22d518ad817d246553de9b82923c04e833eb9ede5a","587c135414bb553495ba4f9142fc2bd826d3443bd20976287f2fb915532e618e","07eb7c963832f4acd61f219db3c55e8d59eb2ac4e6a68b493660d344e996baab"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1350,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"f5ab12c4f803631516689c2c128659268cdad6e830f5d2ea5e1727c7a5e338ff"}
{"parentUuid":"0695d7c9-0548-4c6e-9f8f-129f2b1eb926","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgarW7TB15UoihAPahcoK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Running tunes now update in real time, with the new sections under the tuner's controls. All 349 tests pass and it's pushed to GitHub.\n\n**What you'll see while a tune runs.** A highlighted **Running now** panel appears below the Run all / Cancel buttons:\n\n| Section | What it shows |\n|---|---|\n| **One card per running model** | Its lane (CPU/GPU), stage and setting (e.g. \"Prompt for Code: System prompt\"), a progress bar of answers measured against expected, and the time left |\n| **Trying now** | Each value of the current setting with how many questions it has answered, its score, time and tokens. The current best is highlighted: highest score, or for speed settings the fastest time. |\n| **Decided this run** | The latest decisions and why, e.g. \"Context size: 16384 — the largest that fits in 14.8 GiB free\" or \"Kept 0.2: … short of the p ≤ 0.04 a change needs\" |\n| **Queue** | Waiting, finished and failed models, with the reason for any failure |\n\nA **Models** heading now separates the panel from the model list.\n\n**Real time:**\n- **The server pushes each change the moment it happens,** bundled to at most 4 updates a second, instead of the app asking every 2 seconds.\n- **The connection closes** when you close the dialog.\n- **A fallback covers browsers the stream can't serve:** a browser on another computer has to send the access key, which a stream connection can't carry, so it falls back to polling every 2 seconds.\n\n**How it's checked so far:**\n- **Unit tests** cover the scheduler's live summary and the server stream: the job is sent at once, then each change, and listening stops when the page closes.\n- **The panel's layout** I checked in the browser with a *simulated* stream: two running models, one waiting, one finished.\n- **The real end-to-end check is still to do.** A real tune through the app would distort the baseline, which is measuring speed right now. I'll do it as soon as the baseline finishes, and keep the task open until then.\n\n**Limit:** only tunes started from the app appear live. A tune started from the command line, like the baseline running now, isn't part of the app, so it doesn't show there.\n\n**The baseline (Coder only, one pass)** has been running since 22:08 and is still in progress. When it finishes, I'll do the real live check, commit the baseline file and push."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":657,"cache_read_input_tokens":914929,"output_tokens":775,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":657,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":775,"cache_read_input_tokens":914929,"cache_creation_input_tokens":657,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":657},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8733936b-d8eb-4a89-8758-5b77581615b7","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgarW6xfezxB74RyhBuQP","requestRef":"b3795129-0b29-4b95-91ed-5087198c830c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d1d75f7-9711-4331-8314-ef417e992374","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:18:45.395Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"master","slug":"noble-squishing-dawn"}
