s applied.</p>\n497\t          <section class=\"tune-live\" id=\"tune-live\" hidden aria-live=\"polite\"></section>\n498\t          <div class=\"tune-continue\" id=\"tune-continue\"></div>\n499\t          <h4 class=\"tune-heading\">Models</h4>\n500\t          <div class=\"tune-models\" id=\"tune-models\"></div>\n501\t          <div class=\"tune-best\" id=\"tune-best\"></div>\n502\t          <details class=\"tune-runs\" id=\"tune-runs\">\n503\t            <summary>\n504\t              Tune runs and statistics\n505\t              <small>Every run with what it measured, answer by answer. Nothing is deleted.</small>\n506\t            </summary>\n507\t            <div id=\"tune-runs-list\"></div>\n508\t            <div id=\"tune-run-detail\"></div>\n509\t          </details>\n510\t          <details class=\"tune-settings\" id=\"tune-settings\">\n511\t            <summary>Tune settings: the values each setting is tried at, lanes and devices</summary>\n512\t            <form id=\"tune-settings-form\" class=\"tune-settings-form\"></form>\n513\t            <div class=\"benchmark-controls\">\n514\t              <button class=\"primary-btn\" id=\"tune-settings-save\" type=\"button\">Save settings</button>\n515\t              <button class=\"small-btn\" id=\"tune-settings-reset\" type=\"button\">Reset to defaults</button>\n516\t            </div>\n517\t            <p class=\"benchmark-progress\" id=\"tune-settings-note\">Lists are comma-separated. Values outside what the app accepts are dropped and listed here.</p>\n518\t          </details>\n519\t        </section>\n520\t        <details class=\"benchmark-reports\" id=\"benchmark-reports\">\n521\t          <summary>\n522\t            <strong>Benchmark gate and reports</strong>\n523\t            <small>The full benchmark run and the statistics of earlier runs. Not needed for tuning.</small>\n524\t          </summary>\n525\t          <label class=\"check benchmark-show-old\">\n526\t            <input id=\"benchmark-show-old\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n527\t            <span>Show reports measured on older test suites</span>\n528\t          </label>\n529\t        <section class=\"benchmark-run\">\n530\t          <div class=\"benchmark-head\">\n531\t            <div>\n532\t              <p class=\"eyebrow\">Live run</p>\n533\t              <h3>Benchmark this computer</h3>\n534\t            </div>\n535\t            <span class=\"badge\" id=\"benchmark-run-state\">idle</span>\n536\t          </div>\n537\t          <div class=\"benchmark-controls\">\n538\t            <label class=\"field\">\n539\t              <span>Phase</span>\n540\t              <select id=\"benchmark-phase\">\n541\t                <option value=\"model\">Model reloading (required)</option>\n542\t                <option value=\"chat\">Model usage (optional)</option>\n543\t              </select>\n544\t              <small>The model phase is the gate; run the chat phase when sampling or prompting changes.</small>\n545\t            </label>\n546\t            <label class=\"check\">\n547\t              <input id=\"benchmark-baseline\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n548\t              <span>Replace the baseline deliberately</span>\n549\t            </label>\n550\t            <label class=\"check\">\n551\t              <input id=\"benchmark-download\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n552\t              <span>Download missing models</span>\n553\t            </label>\n554\t            <label class=\"check\">\n555\t              <input id=\"benchmark-full\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n556\t              <span>Full six-model matrix (slow)</span>\n557\t            </label>\n558\t            <button class=\"primary-btn\" id=\"benchmark-start\" type=\"button\">Start</button>\n559\t            <button class=\"small-btn\" id=\"benchmark-cancel\" type=\"button\" disabled>Cancel</button>\n560\t          </div>\n561\t          <p class=\"benchmark-progress\" id=\"benchmark-progress\">No benchmark is running.</p>\n562\t          <p class=\"benchmark-base\" id=\"benchmark-chat-base\">Chat phase base: loading…</p>\n563\t        </section>\n564\t        <div class=\"benchmark-recommendations\" id=\"benchmark-recommendations\"></div>\n565\t        <div class=\"benchmark-phases\" id=\"benchmark-phases\"></div>\n566\t        <p class=\"settings-note\">\n567\t          Read-only report from <code>benchmarks/baseline-model.json</code>,\n568\t          <code>baseline-chat.json</code> and <code>history.jsonl</code>. A live run\n569\t          writes <code>benchmarks/results/latest-model.json</code> and appears here\n570\t          when it finishes. Recommendations only fill the settings form; nothing is\n571\t          applied until you save and reload the model.\n572\t        </p>\n573\t        </details>\n574\t      </div>\n575\t      <div class=\"dialog-actions\">\n576\t        <button class=\"small-btn\" type=\"button\" data-close-dialog=\"benchmark-dialog\">Close</button>\n577\t      </div>"}]},"uuid":"ec46e000-8a14-479d-9f2d-57bc961ae503","timestamp":"2026-10-31T19:23:31.853Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\modelduck\\public\\index.html","content":"    <dialog class=\"dialog benchmark-dialog\" id=\"benchmark-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"benchmark-title\">\n      <div class=\"dialog-head\">\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"eyebrow\">Settings tuner and quality gate</p>\n          <h2 id=\"benchmark-title\">Tune &amp; benchmark</h2>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"icon-btn dialog-close\" type=\"button\" data-close-dialog=\"benchmark-dialog\" title=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">×</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dialog-body benchmark-body\">\n        <section class=\"benchmark-run\" aria-labelledby=\"tune-title\">\n          <div class=\"benchmark-head\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"eyebrow\">Settings tuner</p>\n              <h3 id=\"tune-title\">Find the best settings for each model</h3>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"badge\" id=\"tune-run-state\">idle</span>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"tune-intro\">\n            Measures each installed model on this PC and saves the best settings as presets the app applies\n            automatically, per task (chat, code, math, long context). Results are kept: a stopped tune keeps what it\n            found, and choosing only some stages or settings measures just those again on top of the rest.\n          </p>\n          <div class=\"tune-stage-list\" id=\"tune-stages\">\n            <label class=\"check tune-stage\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"device\" checked /><span><strong>Device</strong><small>CPU or GPU: whichever answers fastest while getting as many answers right.</small></span></label>\n            <label class=\"check tune-stage\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"quality\" checked /><span><strong>Quality</strong><small>Context size and KV cache: the most correct answers.</small></span></label>\n            <label class=\"check tune-stage\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"speed\" checked /><span><strong>Speed</strong><small>Flash attention, memory map, batch and threads: fastest with identical answers. Saves the Fastest and Light presets.</small></span></label>\n            <label class=\"check tune-stage\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"sampling\" checked /><span><strong>Sampling</strong><small>Temperature, answer length, repeat penalty, min-p, top-p and top-k, per task.</small></span></label>\n            <label class=\"check tune-stage\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"prompt\" checked /><span><strong>Prompt</strong><small>System prompt, reasoning off or on, and prompt repetition, per task.</small></span></label>\n            <div class=\"benchmark-controls tune-actions\">\n              <label class=\"check\" title=\"Discard the chosen models' saved results and measure everything again\"><input id=\"tune-force\" type=\"checkbox\" /><span>Re-tune from scratch</span></label>\n              <button class=\"primary-btn\" id=\"tune-all\" type=\"button\" title=\"Tune every installed model with the choices above\">Run all</button>\n              <button class=\"small-btn\" id=\"tune-cancel\" type=\"button\" disabled>Cancel</button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <details class=\"tune-only-details\">\n            <summary>Only some settings (optional; replaces the stage choice above)</summary>\n            <div class=\"tune-only\" id=\"tune-only\" aria-label=\"Only these settings\"></div>\n          </details>\n          <p class=\"benchmark-progress\" id=\"tune-progress\">No tune is running. Pick a model below, or Run all; stop any time and what was found is applied.</p>\n          <section class=\"tune-live\" id=\"tune-live\" hidden aria-live=\"polite\"></section>\n          <div class=\"tune-continue\" id=\"tune-continue\"></div>\n          <h4 class=\"tune-heading\">Models</h4>\n          <div class=\"tune-models\" id=\"tune-models\"></div>\n          <div class=\"tune-best\" id=\"tune-best\"></div>\n          <details class=\"tune-runs\" id=\"tune-runs\">\n            <summary>\n              Tune runs and statistics\n              <small>Every run with what it measured, answer by answer. Nothing is deleted.</small>\n            </summary>\n            <div id=\"tune-runs-list\"></div>\n            <div id=\"tune-run-detail\"></div>\n          </details>\n          <details class=\"tune-settings\" id=\"tune-settings\">\n            <summary>Tune settings: the values each setting is tried at, lanes and devices</summary>\n            <form id=\"tune-settings-form\" class=\"tune-settings-form\"></form>\n            <div class=\"benchmark-controls\">\n              <button class=\"primary-btn\" id=\"tune-settings-save\" type=\"button\">Save settings</button>\n              <button class=\"small-btn\" id=\"tune-settings-reset\" type=\"button\">Reset to defaults</button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"benchmark-progress\" id=\"tune-settings-note\">Lists are comma-separated. Values outside what the app accepts are dropped and listed here.</p>\n          </details>\n        </section>\n        <details class=\"benchmark-reports\" id=\"benchmark-reports\">\n          <summary>\n            <strong>Benchmark gate and reports</strong>\n            <small>The full benchmark run and the statistics of earlier runs. Not needed for tuning.</small>\n          </summary>\n          <label class=\"check benchmark-show-old\">\n            <input id=\"benchmark-show-old\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n            <span>Show reports measured on older test suites</span>\n          </label>\n        <section class=\"benchmark-run\">\n          <div class=\"benchmark-head\">\n            <div>\n              <p class=\"eyebrow\">Live run</p>\n              <h3>Benchmark this computer</h3>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"badge\" id=\"benchmark-run-state\">idle</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"benchmark-controls\">\n            <label class=\"field\">\n              <span>Phase</span>\n              <select id=\"benchmark-phase\">\n                <option value=\"model\">Model reloading (required)</option>\n                <option value=\"chat\">Model usage (optional)</option>\n              </select>\n              <small>The model phase is the gate; run the chat phase when sampling or prompting changes.</small>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"check\">\n              <input id=\"benchmark-baseline\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n              <span>Replace the baseline deliberately</span>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"check\">\n              <input id=\"benchmark-download\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n              <span>Download missing models</span>\n            </label>\n            <label class=\"check\">\n              <input id=\"benchmark-full\" type=\"checkbox\" />\n              <span>Full six-model matrix (slow)</span>\n            </label>\n            <button class=\"primary-btn\" id=\"benchmark-start\" type=\"button\">Start</button>\n            <button class=\"small-btn\" id=\"benchmark-cancel\" type=\"button\" disabled>Cancel</button>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"benchmark-progress\" id=\"benchmark-progress\">No benchmark is running.</p>\n          <p class=\"benchmark-base\" id=\"benchmark-chat-base\">Chat phase base: loading…</p>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"benchmark-recommendations\" id=\"benchmark-recommendations\"></div>\n        <div class=\"benchmark-phases\" id=\"benchmark-phases\"></div>\n        <p class=\"settings-note\">\n          Read-only report from <code>benchmarks/baseline-model.json</code>,\n          <code>baseline-chat.json</code> and <code>history.jsonl</code>. A live run\n          writes <code>benchmarks/results/latest-model.json</code> and appears here\n          when it finishes. Recommendations only fill the settings form; nothing is\n          applied until you save and reload the model.\n        </p>\n        </details>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"dialog-actions\">\n        <button class=\"small-btn\" type=\"button\" data-close-dialog=\"benchmark-dialog\">Close</button>\n      </div>","numLines":122,"startLine":456,"totalLines":583}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f28933de-d729-43ae-87cd-9ab90b369e47","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\modelduck","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"master","slug":"noble-squishing-dawn"}
