{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","hash":"df86f1993af20533623de37b4fac10ecf960999570d618b025959e3982c27bf1","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Both read well. One leftover: the Tune tab still says \"Pick a model **below**\", but the models are now in their own tab. Fixing that, then closing the UI task and committing:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013DqSy36Fk6BdYFe3NPXuNX","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck && sed -i 's/No tune is running. Pick a model below, or Run all; stop any time and what was found is applied./No tune is running. Pick a model in the Models tab, or Run all; stop any time and what was found is applied./' public/index.html && grep -c \"Pick a model in the Models tab\" public/index.html && npm test 2>&1 | grep -q \"^ℹ fail 0\" || { echo \"TESTS FAILED\"; exit 1; }; (cd ../.. && python aikit.py ui finish modelduck --reviewed --reviewer \"Claude (AI; headless Edge review of the five Bench tabs: each shows only its panel, the run list loads on its tab, the last tab is remembered, no tab is longer than about two screens; no console errors; delegated by the user on 2026-11-01)\" 2>&1 | tail -2) > /tmp/finish-tabs.out; cat /tmp/finish-tabs.out; grep -q \"UI task closed\" /tmp/finish-tabs.out || exit 1; cd ../.. && python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep -q \"4/4 gates passed\" || { echo \"GATE FAILED\"; python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep \"   - \"; exit 1; }; MSG='feat(ui): split the Tune and benchmark dialog into tabs\n\nTune, Models, Runs, Tune settings and Benchmark gate each get a tab;\nthe last one used is remembered, a started tune shows on the Tune tab,\nand the tab carries a dot while a tune runs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>' && python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --validate-commit \"$MSG\" >/dev/null || exit 1; cd projects/modelduck && git add public/index.html public/app.js public/styles.css .aikit/ui_history.json && git commit -q -m \"$MSG\" && git log --oneline -1 && git status --short && cd ../.. && python aikit.py check modelduck --strict 2>&1 | grep -q \"4/4 gates passed\" || { echo \"STRICT FAILED\"; exit 1; }; python aikit.py publish modelduck --owner AegeanWorks --license keep 2>&1 | grep -E \"OK|FAIL\" | head -1","description":"Fix the hint, close the UI task, commit and push the tabs","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
