{"parentUuid":"359bbd64-2fcf-434f-8d65-0b902ecfc3de","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgasXaK71WR5vdFuYkeA6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017FH3xwAbUr6Pw9pqhum7yR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"npm test 2>&1 | grep -q \"^ℹ fail 0\" || { echo \"TESTS FAILED\"; exit 1; }; (cd ../.. && python aikit.py ui finish modelduck --reviewed --reviewer \"Claude (AI; headless Edge review with a sample per-task check in a scratch profile: Details states each task's result under the shared quality settings and which task sent them back; no console errors; delegated by the user on 2026-11-01)\" 2>&1 | tail -2) > /tmp/finish-check.out; cat /tmp/finish-check.out; grep -q \"UI task closed\" /tmp/finish-check.out || exit 1; cat >> .aikit/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n### ADR-057: The shared quality settings are checked on every task\n- **Date**: 2026-11-01\n- **Status**: Accepted\n- **Context**: Device, quality and speed settings are shared by all of a model's tasks; only sampling and prompt are per task. The quality stage (context and KV cache) chooses on a mix of every task's items, so a setting much better on one task could win while clearly hurting another.\n- **Decision**: After the quality stage, each task's share of the last load level (`rungs.loadByTask`) is scored with the chosen settings and with the settings before the stage, paired, from the answers the sweep already measured. A task worse at `changeAlpha` (0.2, uncorrected, so every task is protected) sends the quality settings back to those before the stage. The profile's load carries `perTask` (each task's rate before and after, p, worse) and `reverted` (the task that lost); Details and a run's detail state it.\n- **Consequences**: A shared setting can no longer trade one task for another unnoticed. Since the check uses already-measured answers, it costs nothing extra.\nEOF\ncd ../.. && python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep -q \"4/4 gates passed\" || { echo \"GATE FAILED\"; python aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep \"   - \"; exit 1; }; python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --workspace projects/modelduck --checkpoint bench-types --agent claude-opus-5.5 --phase verification --phase-num 4 --desc \"Milestone 2 per-task quality check in; tests pass, gate 4/4, Edge review; checklists: passed\" | tail -1 && MSG='feat(ui): [milestone 2/3] show the per-task check of quality settings\n\nDetails and a run'\"'\"'s detail state each task'\"'\"'s result under the shared\nquality settings and which task, if any, sent them back (ADR-057).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>' && python scripts/disruption_recovery.py --validate-commit \"$MSG\" >/dev/null || exit 1; cd projects/modelduck && git add public/app.js .aikit/ui_history.json .aikit/decisions.md .aikit/task_ledger.json && git commit -q -m \"$MSG\" && git log --oneline -1 && git status --short","description":"Close the UI task, add ADR-057, gate and commit milestone 2","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1113,"cache_read_input_tokens":963082,"output_tokens":1183,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1113,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1183,"cache_read_input_tokens":963082,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1113,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1113},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017FH3xwAbUr6Pw9pqhum7yR":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck && npm test 2>&1 |