tant","uuid":"c0d9c5a5-64e4-4fc9-b5f7-887d277ce048","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:00:55.395Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Yunus-Emre\\Desktop\\portable_agent_kit\\projects\\modelduck","sessionId":"20b8d1d8-5397-4bf1-8838-6d05c82b6c1d","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"master","slug":"noble-squishing-dawn"}
{"parentUuid":"c0d9c5a5-64e4-4fc9-b5f7-887d277ce048","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"bcb4eca5-d71f-4719-8be6-c39f68cbc6f4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013XZYgczdNGKKpgN7mnL69P","type":"tool_result","content":"# Benchmark test changelog\n\nThe test definitions are versioned separately from the application and from the\nmodel settings. Every run records `suiteVersion` and a SHA-256 `testHash` of the\nprompts, checks and matrix entries. If those definitions change, the hash changes\nand the baseline must be updated deliberately; a result delta is then visibly a\ntest change, not a model/settings regression.\n\n| Version | Date | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| v1 | 2026-10-30 | Initial 9 tasks: exact word, arithmetic, factual, reasoning, JSON, JavaScript, lowercase, list, needle. |\n| v2 | 2026-10-30 | Added HellaSwag-style choice, MMLU-style choice, GSM8K-style word problem, reading comprehension and bug-fix tasks. |\n| v3 | 2026-10-30 | Split into model-reload and chat-usage phases; added quantization, KV cache, context/batch/thread/sequence/flash/mmap/checkpoint variants and sampling/system/reasoning/prompt-repeat/structured-output variants. |\n| v4 | 2026-10-30 | Hash the global and per-variant system prompts, `promptIds`, effective sampling defaults and the generation-manifest version. Every run also records node-llama-cpp/Node versions, model chat-template hashes and a per-generation manifest digest; a runtime, model-file size or chat-template mismatch is refused like a test-hash mismatch. |\nREADME.md:135:deeper review takes hours on a CPU and is opt-in. Suite v12 runs 310 items: 250\nREADME.md:498:│   ├── own-items-v12.mjs\nREADME.md:537:│   ├── benchmark-suite-v12.test.js","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d9649aea-b09c-4d3c-9a6f-88035e58874e","timestamp":"2026-10-31T20:00:56.303Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Benchmark test changelog\n\nThe test definitions are versioned separately from the application and from the\nmodel settings. Every run records `suiteVersion` and a SHA-256 `testHash` of the\nprompts, checks and matrix entries. If those definitions change, the hash changes\nand the baseline must be updated deliberately; a result delta is then visibly a\ntest change, not a model/settings regression.\n\n| Version | Date | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| v1 | 2026-10-30 | Initial 9 tasks: exact word, arithmetic, factual, reasoning, JSON, JavaScript, lowercase, list, needle. |\n| v2 | 2026-10-30 | Added HellaSwag-style choice, MMLU-style choice, GSM8K-style word problem, reading comprehension and bug-fix tasks. |\n| v3 | 2026-10-30 | Split into model-reload and chat-usage phases; added quantization, KV cache, context/batch/thread/sequence/flash/mmap/checkpoint variants and sampling/system/reasoning/prompt-repeat/structured-output variants. |\n| v4 | 2026-10-30 | Hash the global and per-variant system prompts, `promptIds`, effective sampling defaults and the generation-manifest version. Every run also records node-llama-cpp/Node versions, model chat-template hashes and a per-generation manifest digest; a runtime, model-file size or chat-template mismatch is refused like a test-hash mismatch. |\nREADME.md:135:deeper review takes hours on a CPU and is opt-in. Suite v12 runs 310 items: 250\nREADME.md:498:│   ├── own-items-v12.mjs\nREADME.md:537:│   ├── benchmark-suite-v12.test.js","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"5cc0058c-0bab-4d57-a1b7-099b7ddaa299","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck","root":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck","branch":"master","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":4,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":3},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"AegeanWorks/Modelduck","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remote