{"parentUuid":"9338cce3-2983-40fe-aaff-f6837995a6d4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgaumAzm2X3AHR5unKYBG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017F9k8eW8ZSzfyCuLoJSysP","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> .aikit/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n### ADR-060: Suite v13 fills the thin question types and gives math 48 tuning items\n- **Date**: 2026-11-01\n- **Status**: Accepted\n- **Context**: The Benchmark tab (ADR-058) showed knowledge with 3 items, long functions and long bug fixes with 6 each, and math tuning on 38 items while chat and code tune on 48, so per-type results (ADR-056, ADR-059) could rarely tell anything apart.\n- **Decision**: `benchmarks/own-items-v13.mjs` adds 9 knowledge questions, 6 long functions to write (an LRU cache, a query-string parser, a dependency sort, a text table, the next calendar day, a Sudoku check), 6 long functions with more than one bug each, and 13 math word problems. Each long function passes its cases with a reference in `tests/reference-solutions-v13.js`, each buggy function fails at least two of its cases, and each math answer is worked out again independently in `tests/benchmark-suite-v13.test.js`. With 64 math items, the last quarter of each bucket (16) is held back and math tunes on 48.\n- **Consequences**: 344 items, suite v13: every saved profile and the tune:gate baseline are stale until re-tuned. The exact suite totals are now pinned by the v13 test; the v12 test checks at least its own total, and the v9 counts are taken over the v9 items only, so no earlier check got looser about what it covers.\nEOF\ncd ../.. && python aikit.py checkpoint modelduck --agent claude-opus-5.5 --task suite-v13 --phase-num 4 --desc \"[2/3] suite v13: 34 items for knowledge, long functions, long bug fixes and math, with references, failing buggy versions and derived answers (ADR-060). checklists: passed\" 2>&1 | tail -1 && cd projects/modelduck && timeout 500 npm test 2>&1 | grep -E \"^ℹ (pass|fail)\" && git add benchmarks/own-items-v13.mjs benchmarks/suite.mjs benchmarks/CHANGELOG.md tests/benchmark-suite-v6.test.js tests/benchmark-suite-v9.test.js tests/benchmark-suite-v12.test.js tests/benchmark-suite-v13.test.js tests/reference-solutions-v13.js README.md .aikit/decisions.md .aikit/task_ledger.json && timeout 400 python ../../aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep -E \"gates passed|FAIL|WARN\" | head -5","description":"Record ADR-060, checkpoint, test and gate","timeout":600000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_read_input_tokens":187582,"output_tokens":1310,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":271},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1310,"cache_read_input_tokens":187582,"cache_creation_input_tokens":471,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":471},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017F9k8eW8ZSzfyCuLoJSysP":{"command":"cd /c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck && cat >> .aikit/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n### ADR-060: Suite v13 fills the thin question types and gives math 48 tuning items\n- **Date**: 2026-11-01\n- **Status**: Accepted\n- **Context**: The Benchmark tab (ADR-058) showed knowledge with 3 items, long functions and long bug fixes with 6 each, and math tuning on 38 items while chat and code tune on 48, so per-type results (ADR-056, ADR-059) could rarely tell anything apart.\n- **Decision**: `benchmarks/own-items-v13.mjs` adds 9 knowledge questions, 6 long functions to write (an LRU cache, a query-string parser, a dependency sort, a text table, the next calendar day, a Sudoku check), 6 long functions with more than one bug each, and 13 math word problems. Each long function passes its cases with a reference in `tests/reference-solutions-v13.js`, each buggy function fails at least two of its cases, and each math answer is worked out again independently in `tests/benchmark-suite-v13.test.js`. With 64 math items, the last quarter of each bucket (16) is held back and math tunes on 48.\n- **Consequences**: 344 items, suite v13: every saved profile and the tune:gate baseline are stale until re-tuned. The exact suite totals are now pinned by the v13 test; the v12 test checks at least its own total, and the v9 counts are taken over the v9 items only, so no earlier check got looser about what it covers.\nEOF\ncd ../.. && python aikit.py checkpoint modelduck --agent claude-opus-5.5 --task suite-v13 --phase-num 4 --desc \"[2/3] suite v13: 34 items for knowledge, long functions, long bug fixes and math, with references, failing buggy versions and derived answers (ADR-060). checklists: passed\" 2>&1 | tail -1 && cd projects/modelduck && timeout 500 npm test 2>&1 | grep -E \"^ℹ (pass|fail)\" && git add benchmarks/own-items-v13.mjs benchmarks/suite.mjs benchmarks/CHANGELOG.md tests/benchmark-suite-v6.test.js tests/benchmark-suite-v9.test.js tests/benchmark-suite-v12.test.js tests/benchmark-suite-v13.test.js tests/reference-solutions-v13.js README.md .aikit/decisions.md .aikit/task_ledger.json && timeout 400 python ../../aikit.py check modelduck 2>&1 | grep -E \"gates passed|FAIL|WARN\" | head -5","description":"Record ADR-060, checkpoint, test and gate","timeout":600000}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_017F9k8eW8ZSzfyCuLoJSysP":{"cwd":"/c/Users/Yunus-Emre/Desktop/portable_agent_kit/projects/modelduck"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"8828a2e0-cb50-4c92-ba23-2211a5f631ce","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgaumAiPtqJPnJmvKumvF","requestRef":"d541604f-69f5-42